# Keeps the native iOS packaging out of the Vercel deployments.
#
# Both Vercel projects serve static files straight from their Root Directory
# (see DEPLOYMENT.md), so without this the generated Xcode project would be
# uploaded and publicly served under /ios/. None of these paths existed before
# the iOS pipeline was added, so nothing that was previously deployed changes.
ios/
www/
scripts/
capacitor.config.json
.github/
